.*
_*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.github
!.pubignore
!.fvmrc
# Which MCP servers this project offers. `fw init` writes it, and it describes
# the project rather than the machine, so it is shared like the config above.
!.mcp.json

# And how a client should treat that server. Shared for the same reason — the
# limits below are properties of what this server answers, not of a machine.
# The directory has to be un-ignored before anything inside it can be, and
# everything else in it (settings.local.json, whatever a client writes next)
# stays out.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Files and directories created by pub.
.dart_tool/
.packages

# Conventional directory for build output.
build/

*.iml

# Flutter-related
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Pods/
generated_plugin_registrant.dart

# don't check in golden failure output
**/failures/*.png

/doc/ideas
# FVM Version Cache
.fvm/
